'''Darkness Shade''' is mob that spawns during the [[Great Spook (event)|Great Spook event]], after the death of a {{MobSprite|Primal Fear}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Darkness''' will blind the player and walk slowly towards them once spawned dealing {{Stat|dmg|1}}. They have {{Stat|hp|5}} and like [[Spooky Mobs]], take only {{Stat|Damage|1}} per hit. After being hit, they teleport to a random location near the player and will say up to three lines of dialogue.

