== Bugs ==
*Occasionally, a '''Darkness Shade''' will not die after 5 attacks and requires a 6th hit to kill it.

== Tips ==
*The player can wear a {{Item|Cow Hat}} to bypass the {{PotN|Blindness}} effect inflicted by '''Darkness Shades'''.

